

<div class='p-5 mb-4 bg-light rounded-3'>

  <h1 class='display-4'><%= t(:library_class_request_form) %></h1>
  <hr class='primary'/>
  <div class="container-fluid mt-4">
    <div class="row d-flex align-items-stretch mt-4 border-1">
      <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 d-flex">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column p-3 bg-light border rounded w-100">
          <h3>Introduction to Library Research</h3>
          <p>Are you concerned that your students do not have the introductory library skills to complete assignments in your course? The four-class series "Think, Research, Create: Introduction to Library Research", may be the answer. These four classes: </p>
          
          <ul>
            <li>Are 90-minutes each</li>
            <li>Focus on distinct knowledge and skills </li>
            <li>Employ active learning principles </li>
            <li>Are synchronously taught over Zoom or in person </li>
            <li>Are offered multiple times a term </li>
          </ul>
          
          <p>Students can receive a certificate of completion or participation for each class they attend.  </p>
          <p>If you are interested in this series and how to incorporate it into your course, please fill out the quick form below </p>
          <p class="text-danger small fw-2">*** Coming Soon *** </p>
          <%= link_to "#", class: 'btn btn-lg btn-success w-100 disabled', 'aria-disabled': 'true' do %>
            <span><i class='fas fa-chalkboard-teacher mr-2'></i> Introduction to Library Skills form</span>
          <% end %>
        
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 d-flex">
        <!-- <div class="p-3 bg-light border rounded mb-3"> -->
        <div class="d-flex flex-column p-3 bg-light border rounded w-100">
          <h3>Customized, Advanced or Graduate classes</h3>
          <p>Does your assignment or course require instruction beyond the fundamentals of library research? If so, please use the booking link below. Please note:  
          <ul> 
            <li>Three weeks is required for scheduling purposes </li>
            <li>The class should be scheduled a week or so after students have received their assignments / topics </li>
            <li>Instructors must be present throughout the class to engage with students and answer questions about the assignment / topics </li>
          </ul>
          <br/>
          <p class="text-success fw-2 small mt-auto">Available</p>
          <%= link_to new_user_teaching_request_path, class: 'btn btn-lg btn-success w-100' do %>
            <span><i class='fa fa-graduation-cap mr-2'></i> Request Form</span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mt-3">
      <div class="col-12 text-center">
        <p style="background-color: #eee" class="p-2"><%= raw t(:for_questions_and_suggestions, scope: :request_schedule_bullets) %>
        <%== Setting.questions_inquiries_contact %></p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div> <!-- jumbo -->
